height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "360 （72.1）", "bbox": {"x": 173.0, "y": 1874.4, "width": 96.39999999999998, "height": 26.700000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "7（1.4）", "bbox": {"x": 208.4, "y": 1842.8, "width": 60.900000000000006, "height": 25.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "28（5.6）", "bbox": {"x": 198.7, "y": 1778.7, "width": 70.5, "height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "17 （3.4）", "bbox": {"x": 198.7, "y": 1746.7, "width": 70.5, "height": 19.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "13 （2.6）", "bbox": {"x": 201.9, "y": 1714.6, "width": 67.29999999999998, "height": 19.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "10（2.0）", "bbox": {"x": 198.7, "y": 1679.4, "width": 70.5, "height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "7（1.4）", "bbox": {"x": 211.6, "y": 1615.3, "width": 54.50000000000003, "height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "30 （6.0）", "bbox": {"x": 198.7, "y": 1583.2, "width": 70.5, "height": 25.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "19 （3.8）", "bbox": {"x": 198.7, "y": 1551.2, "width": 70.5, "height": 25.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "499", "bbox": {"x": 227.6, "y": 1519.1, "width": 41.70000000000002, "height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "glycol (PEG) (Table 2). Other common queries", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 1429.4, "width": 657.0999999999999, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "included vaccination safety/efficacy in the setting of", "bbox": {"x": 147.4, "y": 1397.4, "width": 660.3, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "various comorbidities, including autoimmune disposter in the sain of", "bbox": {"x": 138.7, "y": 1354.6, "width": 669.1000000000001, "height": 132.9000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ease, history of venous or arterial thrombosis, and", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 1330.1, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "immunodeficiency.", "bbox": {"x": 573.3, "y": 1297.6, "width": 234.79999999999995, "height": 31.90000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "An important category of eConsult involved pos-", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 1262.7, "width": 634.7, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "sible reaction to a first dose of the COVID-19 vac-", "bbox": {"x": 157.1, "y": 1233.9, "width": 650.7, "height": 25.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "cine. Commonly reported concerns included possible", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 1195.4, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "IgE-mediated response, delayed skin rashes, and neu-", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 1163.4, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "rologic symptoms such as paresthesia post immu-", "bbox": {"x": 153.7, "y": 1127.4, "width": 654.2, "height": 33.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "nization. This comprised a significant number of", "bbox": {"x": 147.4, "y": 1096.1, "width": 660.3, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "eConsults, but was likely underrepresented as a whole", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 1064.0, "width": 657.0999999999999, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "given rising numbers of first doses rates administered", "bbox": {"x": 153.6, "y": 1027.0, "width": 654.4, "height": 36.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "in the latter months of our study [20].", "bbox": {"x": 352.6, "y": 996.7, "width": 455.19999999999993, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The eConsult process did effectively alter the", "bbox": {"x": 150.5, "y": 962.0, "width": 631.8, "height": 35.39999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "planned clinical path for a significant number of", "bbox": {"x": 147.4, "y": 929.4, "width": 660.3, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "patients studied. 72.1% of Consults reviewed", "bbox": {"x": 153.7, "y": 894.0, "width": 654.3, "height": 36.89999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(360/499) were answered by specialist electronically", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 862.1, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "without requirement for external resources or refer-", "bbox": {"x": 157.0, "y": 829.1, "width": 650.9, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ral to other specialty (Table 3). After completion of", "bbox": {"x": 147.4, "y": 794.8, "width": 660.3, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "consultation, only a small percentage of eConsult", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 762.8, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "responses recommended in-person allergy assessment", "bbox": {"x": 153.7, "y": 726.3, "width": 654.2, "height": 33.39999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "or another specialist referral. From a PCP perspec-", "bbox": {"x": 153.7, "y": 694.6, "width": 654.2, "height": 35.39999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tive (Table 4), although in-person referral was initially", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 663.4, "width": 657.0999999999999, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "considered in 276/499 cases, 220 of the 276 eConsults", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 631.4, "width": 653.9, "height": 25.600000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(79.7%) were ultimately managed without an in-person", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 596.1, "width": 657.0999999999999, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "referral. These rates are higher than those previously", "bbox": {"x": 153.7, "y": 558.8, "width": 654.2, "height": 34.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "documented with other specialties; 38% in a similar", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 528.8, "width": 650.7, "height": 28.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "study of rheumatology eConsults and 66% in a study", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 496.8, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.80000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "of hematology eConsults [12-14]. Interestingly, PCPs", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 461.5, "width": 657.0999999999999, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "used the eConsult service for 181 patients when they", "bbox": {"x": 150.7, "y": 429.5, "width": 653.8999999999999, "height": 32.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "hadn't intended to refer a patient in the first place,", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 397.4, "width": 653.9, "height": 28.80000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and 9 of those eConsults lead to formal in-person", "bbox": {"x": 153.6, "y": 361.2, "width": 654.3, "height": 35.60000000000002}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "consultation.", "bbox": {"x": 647.5, "y": 333.3, "width": 160.29999999999995, "height": 25.600000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Discussion", "bbox": {"x": 663.2, "y": 267.4, "width": 141.60000000000002, "height": 28.399999999999977}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Summary & explanation", "bbox": {"x": 538.5, "y": 230.8, "width": 269.29999999999995, "height": 25.600000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Our study is the first of its kind to describe an eConsult", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 195.5, "width": 650.7, "height": 28.80000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "platform as it pertains to clinical questions surrounding", "bbox": {"x": 153.9, "y": 163.5, "width": 653.9, "height": 25.599999999999994}}], "ms": 237.57}